What this approach does
- Creates a deterministic, randomized substitution alphabet from a seed (so you can encode and later decode in tests).
- Applies the substitution to letters (preserving case) and leaves non-letters (like dashes) unchanged.
- Uses a placeholder token by default, so you can verify the pipeline safely.
- Provides both Python and Node.js implementations.

